{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Fantasy Franchise</i>, you take fantasy football one step further. You are the owner of your own team. You manage your roster of players, including your starting lineup, while also improving the attraction of your stadium to increase your revenue. Hire reliable coaches to help you as you train your players to take on the titans of the league and fight their way through the playoffs. But don't worry if you can't make it to the top right away\u2014this is a franchise, after all. Use your connections and scout network to draft the strongest players to shore up your weak spots and take another shot at the trophy with the new season!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957110?t=1765200719","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957110?t=1765200719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957110/637a65a73cc12475695ae0e0e7952c42f055970b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765200719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957110/637a65a73cc12475695ae0e0e7952c42f055970b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765200719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3968560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Fantasy Franchise</i>, you take fantasy football one step further. You are the owner of your own team. You manage your roster of players, including your starting lineup, while also improving the attraction of your stadium to increase your revenue. Hire reliable coaches to help you as you train your players to take on the titans of the league and fight their way throu